abstract: "Code, per-split results, tables, figures and run logs for the design of serial (sequential) multibiometric verification thresholds by geometric programming with corner-dominating posynomial FAR-FRR envelopes fitted by exact-dual Lagrangian-relaxation branch-and-bound, evaluated on NIST BSSR1 and a chimeric LFW + BSSR1 subset."
keywords:
  - multibiometric authentication
  - serial fusion
  - geometric programming
  - Lagrangian relaxation
  - branch-and-bound
  - false acceptance rate
